OL,3,GNEWSAHarvest is toughest for 65 years,
OL,4,Afarmer says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vegetable farmer says the drought has
OL,7,Fled to the toughest harvest seen in 65
OL,8,Fyears on his family farm.
OL,10,FMark Nundy, who grows cabbages,
OL,11,Fcauliflowers and broccoli near Boston,
OL,12,FLincolnshire, says the prolonged hot
OL,13,Fand dry weather meant many products
OL,14,Fwere only half the size they should be.
OL,16,F"I'm in my 32nd season and my dad and
OL,17,Fmyself have never seen anything like
OL,18,Fthis... in terms of crop production,
OL,19,Fcrop prediction, crop yield, crop
OL,20,Fquality," he said.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
