OL,3,GNEWSAHarvest is toughest for 65 years,
OL,4,Afarmer says
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrace Duncan, fresh foods editor at The
OL,7,FGrocer magazine, said the conditions
OL,8,Fwould lead to "some shortages on
OL,9,Fshelves". "That means, inevitably, if
OL,10,Fthere is less availability, prices will
OL,11,Fhave to go up."
